# Environment Variable Configuration Template
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to '.env' in your project directory: cp .env.example .env
# 2. Replace the placeholder values below with your own valid credentials.
# 3. NEVER commit your actual '.env' file or any real secrets to Git.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Model & API Providers (Configure only the ones your project requires) ---
# Example: Gemini / Google AI Studio API Key
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# Example: OpenAI API Key
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here

# Example: Anthropic API Key
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_anthropic_api_key_here

# --- Model Settings ---
# Example: Default model name or identifier
# MODEL_NAME=gemini-2.5-flash
# TEMPERATURE=0.7

# --- Application / Server Configuration ---
# Example: Service port and runtime host
# PORT=8080
# HOST=localhost
# LOG_LEVEL=info

# --- External Tooling & Integrations ---
# Example: Web search or database credentials
# SEARCH_API_KEY=your_search_api_key_here
# DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///local.db
